error[8-0130]: `mut?` outside a `mut?` function
   ┌─ maybe_mut_effects.fe:62:18
   │
62 │ contract C uses (ctx: mut? Ctx) {}
   │                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `mut?` is the mode of the function it is in
   │
   = a function has a mode when its signature writes `mut?`: `mut? self`, `x: mut? T`, `-> mut? T`, `uses (x: mut? T)` or a `mut?` bound
